      {
        "id": "DrMundoE",
        "name": "Blunt Force Trauma",
        "description": "Passive - Dr. Mundo gains bonus Attack Damage, increasing based on his max Health.<br><br>Active - Dr. Mundo slams his “medical” bag into an enemy, dealing additional damage based on his missing Health. If the enemy dies they are swatted away, dealing damage to enemies they pass through.",
        "tooltip": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Dr Mundo gains <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(2/2.3/2.6/2.9/3.2% Health) Attack Damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Dr Mundo violently swings his \"medical\" bag, causing his next Attack to deal an additional <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/15/25/35/45 + (5% bonus Health)) physical damage</span>, increased by up to 40% based on his missing Health. If the enemy is killed, Mundo swats them away, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(5/15/25/35/45 + (5% bonus Health)) physical damage</span> to enemies they pass through.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The bonuses from the passive reach their maximum at 70% missing Health.<br />Deals 140% damage to minions. Deals 140% damage to jungle monsters.</span>",
