      "description": "Dr. Mundo resists the first <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Immobilizing</span> effect that hits him, instead losing <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">4% current Health</span> and dropping a chemical cannister nearby for 7 seconds. Moving over it reduces this Ability's Cooldown by 15 seconds and restores <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">4% max Health</span>. Enemy champions moving over the cannister destroy it.<br /><br />Dr. Mundo regenerates <span class=\"text-green-600 dark:text-green-400\">(0.4% ~ 0.65%) max Health</span> every 5 seconds.",
